<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Flour Mills 6-mth profit just up.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Flour Mills 6-mth profit just up.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year result to end-September (In millions of naira)</p>
<p>					   1996	 1995</p>
<p>Turnover				 5,700     4,200</p>
<p>Profit before taxation		 220.4     212</p>
<p>Taxation				    68	  74.2</p>
<p>Profit after taxation		  152.3     137.9</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
